&lt;p&gt;You’re a privacy expert who knows how to navigate global regulations without slowing down innovation.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;You thrive on translating dense legal frameworks into practical guidance for technical teams. If you want to build scalable data protection strategies that actually make sense, this is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As data privacy and AI regulations rapidly evolve, ensuring our tools and operations remain compliant is more critical than ever. &lt;strong&gt;In this role, you’ll take ownership of our privacy-by-design initiatives, shaping how we handle data across our international operations.&lt;/strong&gt; You will influence how product features are built and how cross-border data transfers are structured, ensuring we meet regulatory standards without adding unnecessary friction. Working closely with engineering, AI, security, and HR teams, you’ll turn legal requirements into actionable advice. As Senior Legal Counsel on our Regulatory and Data Privacy team, you’ll be instrumental in modernizing our compliance frameworks and finding ways to use automation to make our legal processes smarter and more predictable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise cross-functional groups (including AI, security, HR, and engineering) on data privacy and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate product features, global data governance, and cross-border transfer mechanisms (like DPAs and SCCs) for privacy-by-design compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and maintain internal and external data protection agreements, privacy policies, and terms of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map our data flows and technical operations to ensure they fit within a coherent global regulatory framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research international regulatory shifts and prepare clear, structured legal memos and comparative analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve legal templates, guidance, DSAR processes, and knowledge databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot and assess legal risks related to new technology laws, technical product design, and data processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive process improvements within the team to boost efficiency, incorporating AI and automation tools where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of adaptability when dealing with novel technical concepts and evolving foreign laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to translate complex legal jargon into clear, practical advice that engineers and product teams can easily use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A lateral, creative approach to problem-solving, backed by thorough research and critical thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset and the ability to navigate complex environments and independently manage competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in optimizing processes and exploring how automation can improve legal workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparency, honesty, and a collaborative approach to working within a global team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least &lt;strong&gt;8 years of post-qualification legal experience&lt;/strong&gt; focused primarily on data privacy, technology law, or digital regulatory compliance, including &lt;strong&gt;substantial experience as in-house counsel advising on privacy and data protection matters within an international technology company&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of successfully implementing EU data protection regulations (GDPR, ePrivacy) into company processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A completed university-level degree in law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to draft clear, legally sound privacy policies, terms of service, and regulatory risk assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means earning the trust of product and engineering teams by giving them clear, actionable legal guidance that helps them move forward. You will have successfully streamlined our data privacy compliance processes, leaving systems better and more automated than you found them. Ultimately, you’ll ensure that JetBrains continues to innovate rapidly while maintaining a robust, compliant, and globally scalable data governance framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If this sounds like you, we invite you to apply.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-TA2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Raisin Group Credit Risk Management team is part of the second line of defense and is responsible for the oversight of credit risks across Raisin’s commercial, treasury, and financial counterparties. While Raisin does not engage in traditional lending, we are exposed to credit risk through receivables, guarantees, investments, and other contractual obligations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team ensures these risks are consistently identified, assessed, monitored, and reported in line with Raisin’s risk appetite and strategic goals. We work closely with Finance, Treasury, Legal, Controlling, and Business Units to maintain a consistent and effective risk framework. We value a collaborative, data-driven approach and foster an inclusive environment that supports continuous learning and diverse perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Credit Risk Manager, you will take full ownership of our credit risk framework, operating as a hands-on builder and independent risk partner. This role requires the resilience to navigate complex stakeholder dynamics, the technical agility to modernize our reporting infrastructure using Looker and Mambu, and the expertise to tackle operational backlogs while ensuring robust risk steering across our diverse portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Credit Analysis:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You will perform independent credit risk analysis of counterparties and transactions (corporates, financial institutions, sovereigns), evaluating financials, business models, and structures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Data Ownership:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You will architect and maintain your own reporting infrastructure using Looker, Mambu, and Google Sheets, ensuring high data quality across all risk processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Strategic Risk Steering:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You will drive data-driven decision-making by creating insightful risk dashboards and reporting that directly influence senior management’s strategic steering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Proactive Portfolio Monitoring:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You will maintain strict oversight of credit developments, identifying sector concentrations and deteriorating risk profiles to facilitate proactive risk mitigation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;14&quot;&gt;Provisioning &amp;amp; Forecasting:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You will manage loan loss provisioning processes in accordance with IFRS 9 and ECL frameworks, including staging assessments and qualitative overlays.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;16&quot;&gt;Regulatory Compliance:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You will ensure strict adherence to internal risk limits and external regulatory requirements (e.g., CRR, MaRisk, Basel III/IV).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;18&quot;&gt;Project Management:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;19&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You will lead or participate in initiatives to improve data quality, enhance systems, and validate models, driving the modernization of our risk infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You will act as a partner to the Front Office, Finance, and Risk Controlling teams, providing expert guidance on credit risk topics while balancing business growth objectives with robust risk management frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Credit Risk professional who operates with a high degree of autonomy, bringing both the technical capability to build processes from scratch and the resilience to navigate complex stakeholder landscapes. The ideal candidate combines deep analytical expertise with the strategic mindset to challenge assumptions and safeguard the Raisin Bank’s risk appetite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstList&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;25&quot;&gt;Professional Background:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;26&quot;&gt; You hold a university degree in Finance, Economics, Business Administration, or a related discipline. Holding professional certifications such as the FRM or CFA designation is an added advantage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;27&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You bring 5+ years of experience in credit risk analysis, risk controlling, or credit structuring within banking or financial services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;29&quot;&gt;Analytical Competence:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You possess a proven ability to assess transactional credit risk, including business models, financial covenants, collateral, and legal documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;31&quot;&gt;Regulatory Knowledge:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;32&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You demonstrate a strong working knowledge of IFRS 9 concepts (staging, ECL) and European regulatory frameworks (CRR, Basel III/IV, MaRisk).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;33&quot;&gt;Operational Resilience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;34&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You demonstrate high personal resilience and comfort navigating a fast-paced, forming fintech environment. You possess the strength of character required to navigate significant stakeholder pressure and thrive on &quot;change the bank&quot; projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;35&quot;&gt;Proactive Mindset:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;36&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You maintain a highly self-directed approach to identifying deteriorating risk profiles and portfolio concentrations, with the capability to take full ownership of the scope with minimal guidance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;37&quot;&gt;Technical Proficiency:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;38&quot;&gt; &amp;nbsp;You are skilled at managing risk data using Looker, Mambu, and Google Sheets. Knowledge of programming skills (Python/SQL) and BI tools (Tableau/Power BI) are a definite asset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;39&quot;&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;40&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You show a proven ability to navigate complex stakeholder dynamics; you possess the strength of character to hold firm on risk decisions under pressure and effectively bridge the gap between the first and second lines of defense.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;41&quot;&gt;Language:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;appsElementsGenerativeaiAstAnimated&quot; data-ast-node-id=&quot;42&quot;&gt; Your primary working language is English; no German language proficiency is required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At Too Good To Go, we have an ambitious goal: to inspire and empower everyone to fight food waste together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;40% of all food produced in the world is wasted. And that has a huge impact on the health of our planet, with 10% of greenhouse gas emissions coming from food waste.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re more than an app: we are a certified B Corporation with a mission to empower everyone to take action against food waste, so alongside our marketplace app, we create educational tools, explore new business solutions - such as our Retail Technologies offering, and influence legislation to help reduce food waste.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We’re growing fast: Our community of 127 million registered users and 253,000 active partners across 20 countries, have together already prevented 489+ million meals from going to waste - avoiding over 1.322.000 tonnes of CO2e!&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building a brand-new engineering hub in London, and we are looking for &lt;strong&gt;foundational Frontend Software Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; to help us kick it off. This is a unique opportunity: you will be joining a completely new team, building a new hub from scratch, and working remotely from the rest of our global Tech organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an integral part of this new product team, you will help define, build, and deliver our product features. You will work towards specific outcomes with the freedom and responsibility to figure out the best way to achieve them together with your team. Your mission will be to help refine, design, implement, deliver, and maintain an international top-class product, ensuring quality, maintainability, and sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have created a single-page React application localized into multiple languages with TypeScript, RTK Query, MUI, and react-router. Developers typically run the SPA locally with Vite or Webpack DevServer (including hot module replacement) against endpoints on test servers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve our frontend applications and user-facing infrastructure to stay ahead of our growth curve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop exciting new features for our customers, partner businesses, and internal systems to improve usability and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement responsive, reliable, and intuitive visual elements and interactive workflows across web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in your team’s agile development processes with a continuous improvement mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strive to deliver international top-class products with maximum quality, performance, maintainability, and accessibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take on additional tasks outside your current boundaries with help from your team to continue to grow and expand your skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Ideal Candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in modern frontend web development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven production experience with JavaScript, TypeScript, DOM manipulation, HTML, and CSS/MUI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of React.js, its core principles (state, props, context, hooks), and modern architectural patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with state management solutions (e.g., Redux / RTK Query, React Context API) and client-side routing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with common frontend tooling, testing, and CI frameworks (e.g., Vite/Webpack, NPM, ESLint, Jest, Playwright).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in building scalable, responsive visual interfaces with strong cross-browser compatibility and user experience design sensibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with RESTful APIs, modern integration patterns, and code versioning tools like Git.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoys actively participating in a cross-functional product team and takes pride in writing clean, high-quality code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We win together:&lt;/strong&gt; Food waste is a big beast to fight. We believe in a #oneteam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We raise the bar:&lt;/strong&gt; We always push for more. We work smart, smash barriers and elevate one another.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We keep it simple:&lt;/strong&gt; Our ambitions are bold but our solutions are simple.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We build a legacy:&lt;/strong&gt; We’re proud of the change we’re driving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care:&lt;/strong&gt; We always look out for each other. Caring is also about the way we do business. We do the right thing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Have To Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to work in a global social-impact company and certified B Corporation! where you can see a real and tangible impact in your role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To be an integral member of our defined product teams. We are eager for you to make an impact and contribute to the product scope and development; Your insights are valuable, and we are here to listen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-life balance is important to us! Focus on the job to be done, not the hours spent, there is no need for overtime. On-call duty is not part of the job, but can be additionally agreed upon should you and your manager both wish it. We believe that happy environments create happy employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We trust in our employees and encourage an autonomous environment that provides several opportunities for employees to contribute, develop and take ownership of their work in a way that works for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To be part of an international company, with over 1,300+ colleagues across 20 countries that are on the same important mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An informal environment, working alongside 190+ passionate people within Tech &amp;amp; Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We celebrate our differences and our successes and have a strong values-driven team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work in a hybrid set-up and value in office work weekly (2 days in office).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We take recruitment very seriously, so please carefully read everything we have written above.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please also check our website and international media in order to get a good overview of Too Good To Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please submit your CV and Cover letter in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please note that we only accept applications coming through our platform. No CV or Cover Letter will be accepted by email or LinkedIn direct messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-LA1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;A Movement for Everyone&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We want to inspire and empower everyone to fight food waste together. With that mission, it’s only natural that we want to build a diverse and inclusive team of highly capable individuals who are passionate about doing things in a better way. We strongly believe we all excel and are more creative when we’re allowed to be ourselves, and we’re committed to a culture where all of us belong.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and all employment is decided on the basis of qualifications, merit and business need. If you need reasonable accommodation at any point in the application or interview process, please let us know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;624&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;624&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THIS IS A REAL STEP INTO CLOSING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You booked the meeting. Someone else closed it. Not here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your number. Your accounts. Your calls. Your deals. Start to finish.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You already know this feeling&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You worked the account for weeks. You found the pain, you got the right person on the phone, you booked the meeting. Then you handed it over and watched someone else take it to signature and pick up the commission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is the seat where you keep it.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The role, in plain English&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own a UK and Ireland mid-market patch and carry a monthly new-business ARR target. You find every opportunity yourself, and you close it yourself. There is no SDR underneath you and nobody filling your diary. We give you the data, the tools, the coaching and a few live opportunities to get you moving. Everything after that is yours to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If that reads as a warning, this is not your role. If it reads as an opportunity, keep going.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll actually be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Picking your target accounts and going after them properly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cold calling. Every week. It does not stop being part of the job when you start closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running discovery that reaches business impact, not a feature checklist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demoing Joblogic to operations directors, finance and business owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-threading, building the commercial case, negotiating and closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeping HubSpot honest and forecasting a number you are happy to be held to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we’ll give you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A structured 90-day ramp &lt;/strong&gt;into discovery, demonstrations, commercials and closing. You will never be guessing what good looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full coaching as standard: &lt;/strong&gt;MEDDPICC is our qualification standard and we will teach it to you, alongside discovery, demo and negotiation training, weekly call reviews and deal clinics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live opportunities at the start &lt;/strong&gt;to get you selling while you build your own engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The data, tooling and tech stack &lt;/strong&gt;to prospect properly, so your time goes on selling rather than list building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A real career, &lt;/strong&gt;with a fast-growing, PE-backed software business scaling to £100M ARR. This is the first seat of a career here, not the last&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You’ll love this if&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 12-36 months as an SDR or BDR and you have smashed your number, and you can prove it with real figures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A cold call that turns into a deal is still the best part of your week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are competitive with yourself before you are competitive with anyone else&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want feedback, not comfort, and you act on it fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to be judged on ARR, not on dials and diary entries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are curious about how businesses actually make money, not just about hitting activity targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
