&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w3y5uf&quot; data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1311&quot;&gt;Lead large-scale cyber and operational resilience programmes, including regulatory alignment with PRA, DORA, and global resilience frameworks, identifying opportunities to leverage AI-enabled workflows and automation to enhance client outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g3rd2&quot; data-start=&quot;1312&quot; data-end=&quot;1542&quot;&gt;Oversee resilience assessments across operational and technology landscapes, including third-party and vendor risk, using AI-enabled analytics where appropriate to strengthen risk identification, resilience, and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12e3e8n&quot; data-start=&quot;1543&quot; data-end=&quot;1757&quot;&gt;Define and implement resilience frameworks, governance models, controls, and reporting mechanisms, ensuring robust governance, validation, and responsible AI practices where AI-supported capabilities are adopted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;l21p3a&quot; data-start=&quot;1758&quot; data-end=&quot;1954&quot;&gt;Drive cyber resilience strategy, including cyber posture assessments, security architecture, cloud security initiatives, and the responsible application of AI to improve resilience capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s3mpjp&quot; data-start=&quot;1955&quot; data-end=&quot;2120&quot;&gt;Lead business development, proposition creation, and strategic client growth while helping shape Capco&#39;s market-leading cyber and operational resilience offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2122&quot; data-end=&quot;2148&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2122&quot; data-end=&quot;2148&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
