&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gc4ddh&quot; data-start=&quot;2285&quot; data-end=&quot;2414&quot;&gt;Proven success leading complex transformation programmes and building trusted relationships with senior executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rvpa8h&quot; data-start=&quot;2415&quot; data-end=&quot;2526&quot;&gt;Strong experience developing propositions, winning new business, and delivering strategic growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1u16cfg&quot; data-start=&quot;2527&quot; data-end=&quot;2661&quot;&gt;Experience building, mentoring, and leading high-performing consulting teams while fostering innovation and responsible AI adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ctsyzy&quot; data-start=&quot;2662&quot; data-end=&quot;2807&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of resilience regulations and practical implementation across frameworks such as PRA, DORA, and global resilience standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
