&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2831&quot; data-end=&quot;3399&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;183qvr8&quot; data-start=&quot;2831&quot; data-end=&quot;2969&quot;&gt;Experience delivering Important Business Services (IBS), Impact Tolerance (ITOL), scenario testing, and resilience embedding programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bf1am&quot; data-start=&quot;2970&quot; data-end=&quot;3097&quot;&gt;Background in cyber security architecture, cloud security, AI-enabled security analytics, or cyber technology implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ynbq8c&quot; data-start=&quot;3098&quot; data-end=&quot;3192&quot;&gt;Experience with vendor risk frameworks, supply chain resilience, and third-party governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8q2zfp&quot; data-start=&quot;3193&quot; data-end=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;Strong track record in thought leadership, proposition development, market engagement, and AI-enabled resilience innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
